---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { siteUrl } from "../content";

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "AboutPage",
  name: "About Claude Model Insights",
  description:
    "Claude Model Insights covers Claude AI models, vibe coding tutorials, and AI-assisted development.",
  url: `${siteUrl}/about/`,
  mainEntity: {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "@id": `${siteUrl}/#organization`,
    name: "Claude Model Insights",
    url: siteUrl,
    description:
      "Expert analysis of Claude models, AI safety, and building trustworthy AI applications.",
    founder: {
      "@type": "Person",
      "@id": `${siteUrl}/#author`,
      name: "Muhammad Younus",
    },
  },
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Claude Model Insights | Who We Are & Why"
  description="Claude Model Insights covers Claude AI models, vibe coding tutorials, and AI-assisted development. Written by practitioners who build with these tools daily."
  path="/about/"
  schema={schema}
>
  <div class="feed-header">
    <h1>About Claude Model Insights</h1>
  </div>

  <article class="article-body" style="max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <p>
      Claude Model Insights is a publication for people who build things with
      Claude. Not hype pieces. Not press release rewrites. Practical analysis
      from someone who actually uses these models every day.
    </p>

    <p>The site covers three areas:</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Model deep dives.</strong> When Anthropic releases a new Claude
      model, we break down what changed, what improved, and what it means for
      your workflow. We test features hands-on before writing about them.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Vibe coding tutorials.</strong> Step-by-step guides for building
      real applications with Claude Code. Most of our readers don't come from
      engineering backgrounds, and our tutorials reflect that. Plain language.
      Real examples. Every prompt spelled out.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>AI development strategy.</strong> How to pick the right model
      tier, manage API costs, handle security, and build content that meets
      Google's E-E-A-T standards in an AI-assisted world.
    </p>

    <h2>What Makes This Site Different</h2>
    <p>
      We don't cover every AI tool under the sun. This site focuses
      exclusively on Anthropic's Claude ecosystem. That narrow focus means
      deeper expertise, more specific advice, and zero filler content about
      tools we haven't used ourselves.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every article includes verified data. When we cite a search volume
      number, it comes from Ubersuggest or Keywords Everywhere. When we quote
      a pricing figure, we verify it against the official source on the day
      of publication. When we compare tools, we've used both.
    </p>

    <h2>Who Runs This</h2>
    <p>
      Claude Model Insights is written and maintained by <a
        href="/author/muhammad-younus/">Muhammad Younus</a
      >, a vibe coder and AI development specialist based in Karachi,
      Pakistan. Read his full bio on the <a href="/author/muhammad-younus/"
        >author page</a
      >.
    </p>

    <h2>Get In Touch</h2>
    <p>
      Questions, corrections, or collaboration ideas? Reach out through our <a
        href="/contact/">contact page</a
      >.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
